@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}

<h2>@ViewData["Title"]</h2>
<h3>@ViewBag.Message</h3>

<p>This application serves as a hotel and country management system. It offers the ability to manage hotel listings, countries, and customer orders efficiently.</p>

<p>The app is built with modern .NET Core technologies to ensure robustness, performance, and ease of use. Features include CRUD functionality for entities, responsive layouts, and accessibility compliance.</p>